    <bpmn:process id="W_W1822" name="W1822. Professional Service &amp; Consulting Fee Tracking" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Consulting or professional service invoice received for capex project
Frequency: ~50–100 invoices/year
Volume: Architecture, engineering, project management, IT consulting fees
Owner: Project Accountant
Participants: Project Accountant, COO, CIO, External Service Providers
Source: workflow W1822 — Professional Service &amp; Consulting Fee Tracking</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1822_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1822_Lane1" name="Project Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1822_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1822_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1822_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1822_Lane2" name="Project Accountant">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1822_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1822_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1822_Start4" name="Consulting or professional service invoice received for capex project">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1822_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1822_Task5" name="Professional services in capex projects: (a) architectural and engineering…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Professional services in capex projects: (a) architectural and engineering design (typically 3–5% of construction cost), (b) project management (in-house or external PM), (c) IT consulting for system implementations, (d) geotechnical survey and soil testing, (e) environmental impact assessment (if required by DENR), (f) legal fees for permits and contracts, (g) audit fees for project cost verification
Responsible (R): Project Manager
Accountable (A): COO / CIO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1822_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1822_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1822_Task6" name="Professional service invoices reviewed and approved: (a) verify services were…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Professional service invoices reviewed and approved: (a) verify services were actually performed (timesheets, deliverables), (b) verify billing is per contract terms (hourly rate, fixed fee, or % complete), (c) approve and process payment, (d) cost charged to project CIP
Responsible (R): Project Manager / Project Accountant
Accountable (A): Department Head
Duration: 1–2 days/invoice</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1822_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1822_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1822_Task7" name="Capitalization of professional fees: (a) directly attributable fees capitalized…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Capitalization of professional fees: (a) directly attributable fees capitalized as part of project cost (architect, engineer, PM), (b) general administrative overhead not capitalized (HQ staff time not specifically devoted to project), (c) financing costs: borrowing costs directly attributable to qualifying asset capitalized per PFRS per W1824
Responsible (R): Project Accountant
Accountable (A): Accounting Manager
Duration: At each invoice</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1822_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1822_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1822_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1822_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1822_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-362 (ensure controlled execution — Project Cost Tracking &amp; Capitalization (PA-40.2).) | - operational: Project Accountant review and approval gate
Owner: Project Accountant</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1822_Assoc10" sourceRef="W1822_Annotation9" targetRef="W1822_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1822_Flow11" sourceRef="W1822_Start4" targetRef="W1822_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1822_Flow12" sourceRef="W1822_Task5" targetRef="W1822_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1822_Flow13" sourceRef="W1822_Task6" targetRef="W1822_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1822_Flow14" sourceRef="W1822_Task7" targetRef="W1822_End8" />
    </bpmn:process>
